## 1. Partnership Vision: Equity, Dignity & Community Belonging
Thank you for considering this community wellness collaboration. Movement and mindfulness practices should never be restricted to exclusive commercial spaces. They belong in neighborhood centers, public parks, libraries, and grassroots spaces where community members can gather with dignity, safety, and cultural affirmation.

With {{ years_teaching }} year{{ 's' if years_teaching != 1 else '' }} of experience facilitating accessible movement across diverse neighborhood contexts, I partner with community leaders to design programs that center belonging, trauma-informed guidance, and non-judgmental community care.

